# PokéVerse Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values where needed.
# Most configuration for Phase 1 uses public APIs that require no keys.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PokéAPI (https://pokeapi.co)
# Free and open — no API key required.
# Uncomment only if you deploy a self-hosted mirror.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_POKEAPI_BASE_URL=https://pokeapi.co/api/v2

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IP Geolocation Provider
#
# Default: ip-api.com FREE tier (HTTP-only, no key required)
#   - Works on http://localhost in development.
#   - BLOCKED on https:// pages (Mixed Content policy).
#
# For production HTTPS, choose one of:
#   Option A — ip-api Pro: https://pro.ip-api.com  (paid, HTTPS)
#   Option B — Proxy via your own HTTPS backend
#   Option C — ipinfo.io, ipgeolocation.io, or similar HTTPS providers
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_GEO_PROVIDER=ip-api
# VITE_GEO_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Future phases (leave empty for now)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
